// ============================================================================
// DATABASE REGISTRY
// ============================================================================

//
// One boot call for every content database, invoked from `beat Start` before
// any encounter. Order is free — the databases do not reference each other,
// they are only cross-referenced at runtime by id (an encounter names actor
// templates, a template names skill ids).
//


function initializeDatabases()
  loadCombatRules()
  loadSkillDatabase()
  loadActorDatabase()
  loadEncounterDatabase()
